<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> AUGUST		  1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.17 vs   1.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.17 vs   1.88</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.03 vs   0.15 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    7.65 vs   3.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    13.73 vs  10.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.73 vs  10.70</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.47 vs   1.64 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   37.17 vs  28.31</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction and trading company</p>
<p>is Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
